    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Orgs with zero blng__LegalEntity__c records defined.
Why it matters: Billing can&apos;t generate invoices with a real remit-to entity. Outbound invoices either fail or default to placeholder values that look unprofessional to customers.
Suppress a finding: only during initial setup.
